PRIVATE REFLECTION: The positive set dad dab gut low cat is monosyllabic C V C. The V inventory in the positives is a/u/o and the letters that ever occur are {a,b,c,d,g,l,o,t,u,w}. The negative set ear cop ego mom ate is chosen to break the same construction:
* ear, ego, ate break the C V C shape;
* cop and mom are C V C but introduce p and m respectively;
* ear also introduces r and e.
Hence the cleanest statement of the rule that makes all five + examples good and all five – examples bad is the e m p r-free C V C rule: a C V C word that contains no e,r,p,m. The same rule is phrased as “stay inside the + letter set” and as “final consonant in {d,b,t,w} and V in {a,u,o}”.

Applied to the five distractors:
* leg = l e g contains e, so it is a canonical – example, the e being the same kind of break seen in ear/ego/ate;
* dam = d a m is C V C with V=a but final m, the same blocking final that rules out mom and cop;
* rat = r a t and car = c a r both introduce r, the letter that rules out ear;
* bin = b i n contains no e,r,p,m. It is the only option that stays e,m,p,r-free, i.e. the only option that can be classified with the + set under the letter-avoidance formulation.

Colleague split therefore tracks the two natural readings of the rule. The leg camp points to the vowel-class/e-introduction break. The dam camp points to the final-m/p break mirroring mom/cop. The bin camp points out that under the e,m,p,r avoidance formulation leg, dam, rat and car are all non-followers and bin is the unique distractor that would follow the pattern. The rat-as-good reading follows the stricter final-consonant-in-{d,b,t,w} reading where rat is the only option with an admissible final t.

Current best synthesis: the + set is e,m,p,r-free C V C. That makes leg, dam, rat and car clear non-followers and bin the only option that would belong with dad/dab/gut/low/cat. If a single canonical non-follower is required, leg is the textbook illustration of the e-introduction break and dam is the textbook illustration of the final-m break; both are non-followers under every reasonable reading. Unresolved is whether the intended single-choice answer is meant to pick the unique follower bin as the odd one out, or to name one of the many non-followers, most commonly leg or dam.

